node_modules/
dist/
.DS_Store
*.log

# Office lock files
~$*

# Video masters.
#
# Tarun's masters land at the repo root and run 70-180MB; the delivered,
# downscaled clips live in public/media and are committed. GitHub rejects any
# single file over 100MB outright, so a master in a commit blocks the whole
# push — which is what happened to Leon Welcome_D1.mp4 (173MB) on 8 Sep.
#
# Anchored to the root on purpose: public/media/*.mp4 must stay tracked.
/*.mp4
/*.mov

# Export payloads. deploy/README.md, deploy/.htaccess and deploy/upload-to-s3.sh
# are tracked — they are the deploy tooling. The built site and the archive are
# not: they are ~130MB each, regenerate from `npm run build`, and this repo has
# already been blocked once by committed video.
deploy/site/
deploy/*.zip
